Package: madridvehicleregistrations
Type: Project
Title: Madrid Passenger Car Registrations Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Miguel",
        family = "Moscardó",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Reproducible analysis of passenger car registrations in the
    Community of Madrid between January 2015 and December 2025. The project
    includes fixed-width data ingestion, cleaning, descriptive and territorial
    analysis, Factor Analysis of Mixed Data, K-means clustering and monthly
    time-series analysis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
